004700000000.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
004800000000.* Hilfetext für den Befehl
004900000000.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
005000000000:HELP NAME='DSPLIBSIZ'.
005100000000Display Library Size (DSPLIBSIZ) - Help
005200000000:P.
005300000000The DSPLIBSIZ command determines the size of a library. The
005400000000size contains the size of all objects included in the library.
005500000000.*
005600000000:EHELP.
005700000000.*
005800000000.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
005900000000.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort LIB
006000000000.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
006100000000:HELP name='DSPLIBSIZ/LIB       '.
006200000000Library - Help
006300000000:XH3.Library (LIB)
006400000000:P.
006500000000Name of the library which size is to be determined.
006600000000.*
006700000000:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
006800000000.*
006900000000:PARML.
007000000000:PT.:PV.Library-name:EPV.
007100000000:PD.Name of the library which size is to be determined.
007200000000:EPARML.
007300000000.*
007400000000:EHELP.
